    <description>This flow was originally a subflow that triggers from a screen flow launched from a button on the Order object, to be initiated when a User has a customer on the phone with an issue and needs to Refund or Reorder their Order. 
We are going to refactor this flow to be triggered from an Agent that Customers can interact with to initiate their own Refunds or Reorders. 
The Input variables this flow needs are productId ex. 01tgK000001DWXnQAO: the product that has the issue, the Quantity: the number of items of this product within the order that have an issue, recordId: the original Order Id, and refundOrReorder: weather the Customer wants to refund the amount to their account or reorder the number of items of the same product for free. 
Needed edits: integrate Quantity into the Refund line so they only refund the portion of the items that have an issue (optional)</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
